  "prefLabel": "Cul-H 201.02 Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Cul-H 201.02 Scope.\n\n(a) These rules shall apply to all hearings required by state law to be conducted by the commissioner at which public comment shall be solicited, except that they shall not apply to adjudicative hearings.\n\n(b) If any requirement set by these rules conflicts with an applicable statute such other authority shall control.\n\nSource. #10218, eff 10-30-12, EXPIRED: 7-1-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/cul-h200.html"
